  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of Infrastructure Projects in the Bekaa region, Lebanon / Lot no 2: solar powered systems for water sources</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">oInstallation of solar powered systems for one well (250hp) in Iaat village, oInstallation of solar powered systems in Beit Chama village;oInstallation of solar powered systems for Ablah waste water treatment plant which serves Ablah, Niha and Nabi Alia villages; oInstallation of solar powered systems for Chamsine spring that serves Central Bekaa villages and East Zahle;</narrative>
  </description>
